  "flightAlreadyInBeforeTakeoff": "Already in before take-off — use the prayer times for your departure city.",
  "flightIshaOpenUntilLanding": "The Isha window does not close until after landing.",
  "flightAfterLanding": "Comes in after landing — use the prayer times for your destination.",
  "flightSunAngleNeverReached": "The sun never reaches the required angle anywhere along this route, so no time can be calculated.",
  "flightHowWorkedOut": "How these are worked out",
  "flightHowWorkedOutBody": "The aircraft is assumed to follow the great-circle route at a steady speed, and each prayer time is solved for the position the aircraft is at when that time arrives. A delay of an hour moves these times by roughly half an hour, and routing around weather can move them by ten to twenty minutes, so treat them as close rather than exact.",
  "flightHorizonAtAltitude": "Measured from the horizon at altitude",
  "flightHorizonAtGround": "Measured from the horizon at ground level",
  "flightGroundHorizonBody": "Times follow the horizon of the ground below the aircraft. From the cabin the sun sets later and dawn breaks earlier than shown, by around twenty minutes at cruise altitude.",
  "flightHighLatitude": "This route crosses high latitudes",
  "flightHighLatitudeBody": "Above roughly 48°, the sun may not dip far enough below the horizon for dawn and nightfall to happen normally. Times for Fajr, Maghrib and Isha there fall back to a proportional estimate of the night. Rulings for prayer at high latitude differ — please follow your marja.",
  "flightSomeNotCalculated": "Some prayer times could not be calculated",
  "flightSomeNotCalculatedBody": "The sun stays above the required angle for the whole route, so those prayers have no calculated time. Please follow your marja's ruling for these conditions.",
  "flightTimeZonesFailed": "Time zones could not be loaded",
  "flightTimeZonesFailedBody": "One of these airports has a time zone this build does not recognise. Tap edit to pick the airports again.",
